      "message_parsed": "Открываем main.css<br />\n <br />\nНаходим<br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">#body_container { background: #E3E3E3; padding: 0 2px 4px; }\n#page_container {\nmargin: 0 auto;\nbackground: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D1D7DC;</pre> <br />\nи заменяем на:<br />\n <br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">#body_container { background: #E3E3E3; padding: 0 2px 4px; }\n#page_container {\nmargin: 0 auto;\nbackground: #FFFFFF url(/templates/default/images/fon.gif) repeat; border: 1px solid #D1D7DC;</pre> <br />\nфоновые картинки должны быть безшовными.<br />\n <br />\nКидаем свою фоновую картинку &quot;fon.gif&quot; в: /templates/default/images/<br />\n <br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/592/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/0/592-341287e17a52749b6be3d2e820e6244b.jpg?hash=DkoVAulAen\" alt=\"fon.webp\" /></a><a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/593/\"><img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/data/attachments/0/593-dfc85e5a92789db9921327893870ad01.jpg?hash=R4vSpk5gn4\" alt=\"370B3B280329_175.webp\" /></a><br />\n <br />\nПример: <a href=\"http://torrent.rus.ec/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://torrent.rus.ec/</a><br />\n <br />\nПолезные ссылки:<br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana'\"><span style=\"color: #000000\"><a href=\"http://patterncooler.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://patterncooler.com</a></span></span></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana'\"><span style=\"color: #000000\"><a href=\"http://bgpatterns.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://bgpatterns.com</a></span></span></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana'\"><span style=\"color: #000000\"><a href=\"http://colourlovers.com/pattern